 routed Chat, Error and NotFound pages.&#10;Chat is available at / and /chat. MainLayout derives from LayoutComponentBase. UI shell / error components are summarized here.&#10;Input callback → Chat page → IChatService; finally the page reloads the selected conversation and sidebar list, including after failures.&#10;The window hides System messages. Pending customer text is UI state and is not a domain ChatMessage." style="shape=note;size=16;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#fffbe8;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1600" width="2240" height="145" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
